 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Is there someone here you don't trust? Be honest.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "Their eyes flick, just for a second, toward the fire. \"Noted. I'll watch too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"This one — Staghorn Sumac. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"This one — Birch Sap. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"I don't distrust anyone exactly — I just haven't finished trusting most of them yet. There's a difference. A slow one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"...What's that supposed to mean?\" Their voice goes careful."
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Still on who you don't trust.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want? I'm listening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"We went over this,\" Carlos says, a little tired. \"I already told you the truth about that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"I've got things to do. People to avoid. You know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Do you still count the days? I lost track days ago.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Good. Keep counting. The days need witnesses. That's all.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"I count meals, not days. Three meals since the rain. Two since the alarm. Days are for people with calendars. I have a stomach.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Still on what day it is.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"I dreamed Antonio was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"A name. Okay.\" You say it out loud, trying the shape of it:"
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "🤝 \"The Company.\" It hangs in the air a moment — then Evdokia grins. It's real now. It has a name, which means it can be lost."
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "🤝 Evdokia is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"I count portions out loud before eating. It doesn't bring anyone back. It just keeps my hands from shaking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Have you ever hurt someone? Since all this started. Not that it matters.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "They nod, slow. \"Okay. Thank you for telling me. That couldn't have been easy to say.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"This one — Pedunculate Oak Acorn. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"This one — Spicebush. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"I don't keep score on that. Score-keeping is how you stop sleeping. I do what the day needs and I don't rehearse it after.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Still on whether you've hurt someone.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" I don't need a statue. I need one good story that outlives me."
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "Evdokia nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Remember me kindly, or remember me loudly. Either works.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 37,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"About that question — What got you through the first week? The very first days.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Shock's underrated. It's the body's way of buying you time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "The ease drains out of it, a little."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Still on what got you through the first week.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want? Just... be straight with me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"Have you heard what they're calling Spool? Isaac is pushing 'The Big Beast'. Everyone's got a name for it and nobody agrees.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "They nod. \"Okay.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "Isaac nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"I listen to everyone and nod. It's a strategy. Probably.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Teach me something. Anything you know that I don't. I mean it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"All right. Show me when we work together.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"I'd like to learn something I can use today. Show me while you work, when you have a moment. That's the whole of it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Still on teaching them something.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"The whole fire was arguing about Spool last night — what to even CALL it. 'The Big Beast' got shouted down. What's your vote?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Names are for when it's dead or known. Right now it's neither, so I retie every loose knot in passing instead.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "Evdokia nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"We'll land on something. We always do — usually the loudest person's idea.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "You show them American Persimmon — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Here's what I think — We never finished talking about what's been happening — we left it mid-thought, 7 days back. 'A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be.'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"I wish there was more to tell. That's it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind? Worth considering.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"I'd follow you out past the treeline. Don't tell the others — they'd want to come too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"People here talk. What they say about you when you're not at the fire — that's the real answer to your question.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Still on each other. Hm.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "Aroha nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"About that question — What's the kindest thing someone's done for you out here? How are you holding up, though?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"That's the good stuff. Quiet generosity. It's holding this whole thing together.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Thank you for saying it straight. Most people perform. I'm tired of performances.\" You feel oddly steadier."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"What's this about? We were just talking. Nothing important.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"All right. Thank you for asking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Yeah? What's up? Not that it matters.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"You saw it too, right? The Auction. Tell me I didn't imagine the lights.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "Evdokia nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"That's the whole of it. Sorry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"We never did finish talking about wanting to be remembered — that was 11 days back. Still on your mind? 'Remember me kindly, or remember me loudly. Either works.'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Walk with me? I want another pair of eyes on something.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "You walk to the tree line with Isaac. Nothing much there — but they talk the whole way, and you learn the shape of them a little better."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"This one — Common Sorrel. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"a spring that runs clear — I'll show you on the map sometime. It's real.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Someday kids will sit by a fire and hear what I did. I want it to be a good one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Still on wanting to be remembered.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Anyway — that's my cross to carry. What's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Evdokia? I'd trust Evdokia with my pack. That's the highest compliment I have.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "You show them American Persimmon — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "Aroha nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "\"Here's the thing: I keep expecting to see them by the fire. Then I remember.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "\"Come get air with me. I need to think out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "You walk to the ridge with Elijah. Nothing much there — but they talk the whole way, and you learn the shape of them a little better."
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "Elijah looks at you, level. \"I told you the truth. You can keep poking it, but it's told.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "\"You're really going to make me say it again?\" Elijah rubs their face. \"Fine — but it's the same truth as last time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "\"Come here — I — yeah. It helps, hearing that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "\"Isaac is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "\"I greet everyone by name each morning. It doesn't bring anyone back. It just keeps my hands from shaking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "Isaac nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "\"The fire feels smaller without Isaac. The rest of us will have to be bigger.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "\"Alright, love. Go do what you need to do.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "\"Thanks for... you know. Just listening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "\"About the creek water run — still need hands. Are you in?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "\"I checked the cistern three times hoping I misread it. 0 liters. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "\"This one — American Hazelnut. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "\"This one — Bael. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "\"Isaac owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "You show them American Persimmon — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 64,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "\"Any regrets? The real kind, not the small stuff, as it were.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "Quiet. \"Yeah. I think everyone's carrying one of those.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "\"I regret the ordinary days I rushed through. All those Columbus, Ohio mornings I spent annoyed at small things. I'd pay anything for one annoyed morning now. Not that it matters.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "\"...What's that supposed to mean?\" Their voice goes careful."
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "\"Still on your regrets.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "\"That again?\" Jorge sighs. \"I confessed that already. I'm not confessing it twice for dramatic effect.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "Elijah nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "\"You said shock got you through the first week. Just kept moving. What's carrying you now?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "\"Still on that personal stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "\"Yeah? What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"They took Elijah — The Blood Tithe, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "Jorge nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "\"That's... pretty much all of it, honestly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 79,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" Evdokia sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "Evdokia seems lighter — something good landed recently."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"We're down to 0 liters of clean water. Haul the creek with me at dawn? Two buckets each, there and back.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"0 liters. That's today's drinking water, and then we're boiling creek water and hoping. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"The Price. They just... took you. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Alright. Catch you later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Good — what's been happening, settled. Feels better said out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"We're down to 0 liters of clean water. I can't carry enough alone. First light, the creek, you and me?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"I checked the cistern three times hoping I misread it. 0 liters. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"They took you — The Price, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"I wish there was more to tell. That's it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "Evdokia nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "\"You said you count the days — someone has to. What's the count today? Still keeping it?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "\"Thank you. I wanted to check.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "\"Still on that personal stuff. That's still where we are.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"One of us is changing. Gabriela — fever dreams, hearing crows. The fire keeps going quiet when they walk up.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "Elijah nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "\"That's the whole of it. Sorry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to that personal stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "Jorge: \"Don't just stand there — you've got opinions, right?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "\"Help me haul something back? Too much for one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "You walk to the cache spot with Jorge. Nothing much there — but they talk the whole way, and you learn the shape of them a little better."
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "\"You talk to it -- the System. Have you ever asked? About the taken -- about Kiara? That is all.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Have you seen Gabriela? fever dreams, hearing crows. Since the strange meat. Nobody taught them that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "They nod. \"Okay.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "\"What's something from your old life that's actually useful here?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "\"Not dumb at all. The people who can't wait are the ones who make mistakes. You're an asset.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "Evdokia nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "\"Thanks for listening. Most people change the subject.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 99,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  }
 ],
