 "funeral": {
  "scriptedBurial": {
   "found": true,
   "respectsOk": true,
   "buryOk": true,
   "buried": true
  },
  "deathBeat": [
   "d34: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Antonio Bae is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.",
   "d34: 🕯️ Antonio Bae is dead — the wild. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging.",
   "d34: The village's quarrel was with Antonio — and Antonio is dead. The sentence doesn't cross the grave. You're someone else now; the docket is empty, but the village remembers."
  ],
  "recoverHome": [
   "d35: That night, they bring Antonio home. Nobody asks you to help carry; nobody has to. By morning the grave is dug by the fire, and the body is laid out beside it. The filling of it is yours."
  ],
  "vouch": [
   "d34: At the grave, Isaac, Jorge, Evdokia and 5 more speak for Gabriela — \"Antonio trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."
  ],
  "systemVoice": [
   "d34: SYSTEM: \"Perimeter violated! This is unprecedented! ...Is this unprecedented? Checking. Yes. Unprecedented.\"",
   "d34: 📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Jorge just put down Spool... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\"",
   "d34: ◈ ARC III — ENGINES. SYSTEM: \"VIEWERSHIP MILESTONE. Organic unit demonstrates compounding capability. Resonance protocols unlocked.\" — Your gifts deepen. Used in sequence, they resonate. The village is no longer just surviving. It is becoming something.",
   "d34: ◈ SYSTEM: \"GRANARY: SEALED. Cool, dark, and full of waiting food. Twenty-four mouths. You are not a camp anymore. You are a going concern. The audience has already commissioned the famine episode. We told them there would not be one.\"",
   "d36: SYSTEM: Oh! It has a NAME. You all love names."
  ],
  "burialWindowSay": [
   "d34: The village's quarrel was with Antonio — and Antonio is dead. The sentence doesn't cross the grave. You're someone else now; the docket is empty, but the village remembers.",
   "d34: At the grave, Isaac, Jorge, Evdokia and 5 more speak for Gabriela — \"Antonio trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens.",
   "d34: ◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)",
   "d35: That night, they bring Antonio home. Nobody asks you to help carry; nobody has to. By morning the grave is dug by the fire, and the body is laid out beside it. The filling of it is yours.",
   "d35: ◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)",
   "d36: ◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)",
   "d37: You say a few words for Antonio. Not a ceremony — just: you were here, and someone noticed you leaving. (-3 trauma)",
   "d37: You bury Antonio. A marker, of sorts. The village will know where. (+4 trauma)",
   "d38: ◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)"
  ],
