 "pdCallTexts": [
  {
   "deadId": "gen_yique6a",
   "entryDay": 34,
   "cause": "the wild",
   "lines": [
    "d34: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Antonio Bae is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.",
    "d34: Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight.",
    "d34: 🕯️ Antonio Bae is dead — the wild. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging.",
    "d34: What Antonio kept close goes into the ground with them — keepsakes are buried, never taken from the body.",
    "d34: \"Antonio's gone.\" Carlos looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Antonio.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face.",
    "d34: The Codex doesn't pause for grief. Gabriela blinks — and it's already there, overlaying everything, syncing. No pen. No paper. The mantle just... transfers.",
    "d34: 📖 LEARNED: Food Preservation (Level 1). Salt, smoke, dry. The big three. Salt draws water out; bacteria can't live without it.",
    "d34: 📖 LEARNED: Boiling Water (Level 1). Rolling boil for 1 minute kills most pathogens. The simplest safe water.",
    "d34: 📖 LEARNED: Wound Care (Level 1). Clean it, close it, cover it. Pressure stops bleeding. Clean water is better than dirty hands.",
    "d34: ⚡ TECHNIQUE UNLOCKED: Precise Mend! Your healing knows where to go. +50% effectiveness. (Your knowledge of Wound Care amplifies your field_medicine.)",
    "d34: 📖 LEARNED: Herbal Medicine (Level 1). Willow bark = aspirin. Yarrow stops bleeding. Plantain draws out infection. The pharmacy is outside.",
    "d34: 🌟 \"MANTLE TRANSFER DETECTED. ...Oh! New face! Same job! Whole new set of tricks. We hardly noticed. (That is a lie. We noticed. The audience CRIED.)\"",
    "d34: 📖 The Codex turns a page: Antonio Bae, 34 days. The mantle passes to Gabriela Herrmann.",
    "d34: 🪞 You wake up somebody else. Gabriela Herrmann, 19 — a line cook. Their hands know different work now: Green Whisper, Green Thumb, Literally, Beard Moss.",
    "d34: ◈ The System updates its file: the new bearer <redacted> \"Gardener of the Living Garden.\" It had a word for this one before the Codex came.",
    "d34: The village's quarrel was with Antonio — and Antonio is dead. The sentence doesn't cross the grave. You're someone else now; the docket is empty, but the village remembers.",
    "d34: At the grave, Isaac, Jorge, Evdokia and 5 more speak for Gabriela — \"Antonio trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens.",
    "d34: The fire knew Gabriela before the Codex did — their name already carried weight here."
   ]
  }
 ],
